       markdown docs in this repo do not yet use START_* markers.
       When you add markers, point ANCHOR entries at them. -->

  <ARTIFACT ID="ART-AGENTS-MD" FILE="AGENTS.md" TYPE="PROTOCOL" STATE="IMPLEMENTED">
